d28ec0729ec40f0ee0b819","name":"taomengyuan-hw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ed/cc/759e309dc338441cf93bb66c66fe287ebf770fc557d1fd070f8b0635c0268026.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/taomengyuan-hw"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167745390,"discussion_id":"525133207193f9c25d8b253862641827e6091283","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>同步逻辑正确性: 在AivProcess()函数的RmsNormRopeScatterCkvKr计算后添加了CrossCoreSetFlag<SYNC_MODE_CUBE_VEC, PIPE_MTE3>(FINISH_VEC_CKVKR)设置标志。这是正确的同步点，因为AIV核完成RmsNormRopeScatterCkvKr计算后，AIC核才能开始依赖这些结果的MatmulCkvKr计算。但需要确保这个设置与AIC核的等待（第823行）配对，且不在初始化函数中提前设置。</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>问题类型</strong>: 同步逻辑正确性</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>文件路径</strong>: <code style='font-size: 11px;'>attention/mla_prolog/op_kernel/kernel_mla_prolog_split_n.h</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 891</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>CrossCoreSetFlag<SYNC_MODE_CUBE_VEC, PIPE_MTE3>(FINISH_VEC_CKVKR);</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>保持AivProcess()函数中第888行的CrossCoreSetFlag<SYNC_MODE_CUBE_VEC, PIPE_MTE3>(FINISH_VEC_CKVKR)调用不变，这是正确的同步点设置。</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-04-09T10:22:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-09T14:15:45+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"67d28ec0729ec40f0ee0b819","login":"taomengyuan-hw","object_id":"67d28ec0729ec40f0ee0b819","name":"taomengyuan-hw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ed/cc/759e309dc338441cf93bb66c66fe287ebf770fc557d1fd070f8b0635c0268026.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/taomengyuan-hw"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":891,"end_new_line":891,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":167745402,"discussion_id":"4d8d929577630853fd3688184569584eeb4428f8","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要解决了MLAProlog算子在特定计算分支（如`enableGroupComputeOpt`）下，立方核（AIC）与向量核（AIV）之间的同步问题。具体而言，当立方核执行`MatmulCkvKr`操作时，需要确保其依赖的向量核`RmsNormRopeScatterCkvKr`操作已完成，以避免数据竞争和计算错误。此外，PR还新增了相应的向量化操作完成状态标识符，以支持该同步机制。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案分为两部分。首先，在MLAProlog算子的内核代码中，于向量核的初始化函数和处理流程末尾添加了`CrossCoreSetFlag`调用，向立方核发送`FINISH_VEC_CKVKR`完成信号；同时在立方核的处理流程中添加了`CrossCoreWaitFlag`调用，以等待该信号，从而确保计算依赖关系。其次，在头文件的常量定义区域新增了`FINISH_VEC_CKVKR`常量（值为`0x9`），为上述同步逻辑提供状态标识依据，完善了算子内部的跨核流水线同步机制。","created_at":"2026-04-09T10:22:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-09T10:22:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167746784,"discussion_id":"452cbd30b4a91cd2b03fc88a6c2160760d65ed61","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-09T10:28:49+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-09T10:28:49+08:00","user":{"id":"67d28ec0729ec40f0ee0b819","login":"taomengyuan-hw","object_id":"67d28ec0729ec40f0ee0b819","name":"taomengyuan-hw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ed/cc/759e309dc338441cf93bb66c66fe287ebf770fc557d1fd070f8b0635c0268026.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/taomengyuan-hw"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167747018,"discussion_id":"38e5f6b00a737b9d7